 a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami","title":"Swami","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibilityDropPoint(_:description:)-7mehr":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"title":"accessibilityDropPoint(_:description:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"accessibilityDropPoint"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UnitPoint","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI9UnitPointV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"description"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ModifiedContent","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI15ModifiedContentV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AccessibilityAttachmentModifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI31AccessibilityAttachmentModifierV"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/accessibilitydroppoint(_:description:)-7mehr","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/accessibilityDropPoint(_:description:)-7mehr"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","abstract":[{"text":"Reproduces the layer hierarchy measured from Origami’s runner render: a full-screen","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"purple canvas, an inset rounded interaction area, and a centered draggable card.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The card maps the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"text":" Position output to its SwiftUI offset. A release","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"projects momentum and applies rubber-band bounds. If its touch-up position is within","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"100 points of center on both axes, the placed graph’s Reset branch pulses Drag’s","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Reset input and returns the card to its origin."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","title":"Interaction_DragView","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView"}}}